<report>
<line><title>Paired proportions</title></line>
<line></line>
<line>Total = <in>n_out</in>,  both = <in>r_out</in>,  first only = <in>s_out</in>,  second only = <in>t_out</in></line>
<line>Proportion 1 = <in>prop_1</in></line>
<line>Proportion 2 = <in>prop_2</in></line>
<line>Proportion difference = <in>prop_diff</in></line>
<line></line>
<line><block name="exact">Exact two sided <in>cum_2</in></line>
<line>Exact one sided <in>cum_1</in></line>
<line></line>
<line>Exact two sided mid <in>cum_2_mid</in></line>
<line>Exact one sided mid <in>cum_1_mid</in></line>
<line></block><block name="approx"><pval>Numbers too large for exact test</pval></line>
<line>Standard normal deviate z = <in>z</in></line>
<line>Approximate two sided <in>p_2</in></line>
<line>Approximate one sided <in>p_1</in></line>
<line></block></line>
<line><subtotal><in>qcl</in> <in>pc</in>% confidence interval for the proportion difference:</subtotal></line>
<line><subtotal><in>lower</in> to <in>upper</in></subtotal></line>
<line></line>
<line></line>
</report>
